OL,3,ATwelve people, aged 19 to 61, arrested
OL,4,Aafter Middlesbrough crash that killed
OL,5,Atwo police officers
OL,6,
OL,7,FTwelve people have been arrested after
OL,8,Fa collision that killed seven people,
OL,9,Fincluding two police officers,
OL,10,FCleveland Police says
OL,12,FNine men and three women, aged between
OL,13,F19 and 61, have been arrested across
OL,14,FTeesside on suspicion of offences
OL,15,Fincluding possession of a firearm and
OL,16,Fparticipating in the activities of an
OL,17,Forganised crime group
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/40
