OL,3,ATwelve people, aged 19 to 61, arrested
OL,4,Aafter Middlesbrough crash that killed
OL,5,Atwo police officers
OL,6,
OL,7,FPC Tom Clough, 38, has been remembered
OL,8,Fby colleagues as "fun-loving" while a
OL,9,Fcollege PC Matthew Blades, 37, once
OL,10,Fworked at said he was "intelligent" and
OL,11,F"kind"
OL,13,FBBC Verify has been looking through
OL,14,Fsocial media accounts - one video,
OL,15,Fpublished on TikTok last year,
OL,16,Fseemingly shows Saddington involved in
OL,17,Fwhat appears to be a police car chase
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/40
