OL,3,ARussia's second-biggest online retailer
OL,4,Atargeted in Ukrainian strikes
OL,5,
OL,6,FRussian President Vladimir Putin said
OL,7,Fon Saturday that Ukraine had opened
OL,8,F"Pandora's box" by striking economic
OL,9,Ftargets and that Russia would hit back
OL,10,Fat Kyiv's "most sensitive economic
OL,11,Fsectors".
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/40
